<title>BRAZIL: Telebras Jan-Oct net 2.202 bln reais.</title>
<headline>Telebras Jan-Oct net 2.202 bln reais.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian state telecommunications firm Telebras said it had a net consolidated profit of 2.202 billion reais in the first ten months of 1996.</p>
<p>It also said its holding reported a net profit of 2.649 billion reais in the period.  </p>
<p>Telebras' gross operating revenues were 13.487 billion reais between January and October 1996, the firm said in a statement.</p>
<p>The company's net operating revenues totalled 10.215 billion reais in the period, it added.</p>
<p>Telebras noted the results have not been audited yet.</p>
<p>-- Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo Newsroom, 55-11-2485412</p>
